    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are not fatigued.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You tap into the powers that created you from Azoph-met’s very essence and grant yourself the powers of the beyond. For the next minute, you gain temporary hit points equal to your level and gain the benefits of a 6th rank Heroism. Once the effect expires, you become fatigued.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you have the Curse of Secrets feat and you have never broken it, once per week your devotion allows you to benefit from an 8th rank heroism instead of 6th when you use this ability.</span></p>"
